#   chains   the handler reaches its trampoline: the port's hook forwards to the original (or re-lifted) body on those paths
#   replaces the handler never does: the port owns the function outright (Makefile MOD_DLL_REPLACES, build check)
#   inline   a DetourAttachEx site inside a function: a site handler spliced into the re-lifted body (Task 12)
